WEBVTT

00:00:01.220 --> 00:00:05.940
<i>In his sleep, the wounded Seth reconciled
 with Melie in the realm of Sidh.</i>

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:10.430
<i>Then, in order to learn
 how to control his rampages,</i>

00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:13.340
<i>he decided to stay
 and train in Caillte's forest.</i>

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:23.130
Should we really be following a mushroom?

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:28.000
Myr said it would lead us out of the forest.
 We'll be fine.

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:34.010
Anyway, I can't believe Seth decided to stay
 in a crazy place like this.

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:37.480
Seth made his decision for himself.

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:40.670
We should have faith in him
 and cheer him on.

00:00:42.170 --> 00:00:43.470
You're right.

00:00:44.020 --> 00:00:47.050
But if what Seth said is true,

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:51.480
I guess there's a device in Caislean Merlin
 that's projecting the Spectres.

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:56.020
And it's controlled by that scarred guy
 and his creepy buddies.

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:58.300
Those guys are nothing but trouble!

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.620
We need to inform the knights
 when we get back.

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:02.750
No, no! We can't!

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:06.620
Then we're supposed to keep quiet
 and let them keep doing such awful things?

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:08.300
That's just it!

00:01:08.300 --> 00:01:12.380
If a scheme this elaborate hasn't been
 brought out into the open by now...

00:01:13.100 --> 00:01:16.510
It means some of the most important people
 in Caislean Merlin are involved.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:24.330
So there's a traitor
 within the Knights-sorcerers?

00:02:56.030 --> 00:03:02.030
<b>The Palace of Schemes 
-Palace-</b>

00:02:57.910 --> 00:02:59.710
<i>"The Palace of Schemes."</i>

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:05.740
Oh, you're here already?

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:10.620
It's all right.
 I have nothing to hide from my people.

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:13.100
Why are we here, too?

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:18.880
How delightful. You may prostrate yourselves
 before me all you like.

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:20.880
Yes, Your Highness!

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:23.060
Now, Brangoire...

00:03:23.060 --> 00:03:23.850
Yes, Highness?

00:03:23.850 --> 00:03:28.170
Do you know what it is
 that keeps this nation united?

00:03:28.170 --> 00:03:30.520
That's right: trust.

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:31.520
Yes, Highness...

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:34.910
The people trust the knights, 
the knights trust me,

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:38.670
and I trust you all, my subjects.

00:03:39.250 --> 00:03:42.660
The Spectres are threatening that trust.

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:46.790
If our bond of trust is betrayed,

00:03:46.790 --> 00:03:51.540
people like the Merchant Barons 
will take this land away.

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.150
<i>Betray?</i>

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:54.320
Yes, Highness.

00:03:54.320 --> 00:03:57.800
All our forces have been mobilized 
in preparation for any eventuality.

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:59.710
Yes, but...

00:04:00.270 --> 00:04:05.050
the people have begun 
to doubt your strength.

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:10.370
I heard that your actions
 in the previous battle were disgraceful.

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:13.440
The Knights-sorcerers were scattered,

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:17.940
and they could not even find any leads
 on the elusive Spectre.

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:22.700
That... was because certain outsiders
 refused to obey orders.

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:24.700
Indeed.

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:26.110
You two.

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:31.200
Would you care to explain why
 you broke Gysoni and acted on your own?

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:40.240
Your Highness, if I may?

00:04:40.240 --> 00:04:41.960
I will allow you to speak,

00:04:42.330 --> 00:04:44.040
Mordred.

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:47.730
I believe Ocoho made the right decision.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:51.520
Without her intervention,

00:04:51.520 --> 00:04:55.610
it's likely that we all would have been 
crushed by the two Spectres.

00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:57.900
She saved us all.

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:00.240
Is this true?

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:03.110
I just... wasn't even thinking anymore.

00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:05.210
I see.

00:05:05.750 --> 00:05:11.490
Would this mean that Brangoire was the
 one who made the wrong decision?

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:14.250
No, I...

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:16.450
What a shame.

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:20.900
From now on, Lord de Gulis will
 command the knight apprentices.

00:05:22.610 --> 00:05:25.630
You will assist him
 until the ordination ceremony.

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:29.390
My deepest condolences.

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:31.390
Ahem, ahem!

00:05:31.740 --> 00:05:36.140
I just happened to be passing by, 
and I thought I heard my name.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:37.900
Could it be that—

00:05:40.420 --> 00:05:42.900
Thought I'd try landing on my nose.

00:05:44.540 --> 00:05:46.880
All according to plan!

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:52.160
<b>Lord de Gulis</b>

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:52.160
My queen,
 I dedicate that somersault to you!

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:56.660
This is Lord de Gulis,
 the first person to defeat a Spectre?

00:05:56.660 --> 00:06:00.920
Gulis, I need you
 to command the apprentices.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:04.220
Just leave everything to me,
 my beautiful queen!

00:06:04.220 --> 00:06:09.870
For your sake, I, Gulis, would leap
 into flames or even into roses.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:14.030
What a beautiful apprentice you are.

00:06:14.030 --> 00:06:16.050
I can't contain myself!

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:17.460
Please, take this rose!

00:06:17.460 --> 00:06:18.500
No, thank you!

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:20.100
Now, don't say that.

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.310
Your mouth is bleeding!

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:24.820
That's intentional!
 All according to plan!

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:29.160
I told you. I don't want it!

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:31.570
How fierce!

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:34.840
Yes, yes. All of you, leave me.

00:06:34.840 --> 00:06:37.080
I am very busy.

00:06:44.090 --> 00:06:46.340
Shut up! Shut up, I said!

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:51.930
Not only did you act on your own,
 but you also entered Caillte's forest.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:54.370
Have you not been a bit too self-indulgent?

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:58.850
Such behavior is unbefitting 
of a future knight.

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:00.850
But...

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:03.960
That's exactly how a 
dauntless lady knight should be!

00:07:03.960 --> 00:07:07.110
You did so well, Ocoho!

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:08.490
Your Highness...

00:07:10.260 --> 00:07:13.110
You have all my support.

00:07:13.110 --> 00:07:15.620
I can't help feeling
 that we are of one mind.

00:07:15.620 --> 00:07:18.620
Oh, gosh... I-I'm honored!

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:21.120
But you should be careful.

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:24.000
There are certain behaviors 
that men are applauded for,

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:27.880
but when women do the same, 
they're seen as impertinent.

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:34.090
They may hold me at the top,
 but the knights are a society of men.

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:37.140
There are those
 who do not see you favorably.

00:07:37.690 --> 00:07:39.090
Take my advice:

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:42.740
try not to draw too much attention 
to yourself until your ordination.

00:07:43.650 --> 00:07:45.380
O-Okay!

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:48.820
Incidentally, what was the forest like?

00:07:48.820 --> 00:07:50.310
Well? Tell me!

00:07:50.310 --> 00:07:53.450
Huh? Oh, um... It was weird!

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:55.160
"Weird" in what way?

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:58.790
Um... There are walking mushrooms and stuff.

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:00.660
Really? What else?

00:08:00.660 --> 00:08:01.890
What else?!

00:08:01.890 --> 00:08:06.010
Um, there are lots of weird things,
 and odd-colored birds.

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:12.020
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:19.050
Maybe you should pop that open
 for him now.

00:08:19.050 --> 00:08:20.490
He might drown.

00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:24.310
He will? What a fragile creature.

00:08:29.780 --> 00:08:31.820
A-Are you trying to kill me?!

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:34.210
Goodness, you really know nothing.

00:08:34.210 --> 00:08:37.820
If I hadn't saved you,
 you would've died long ago.

00:08:37.820 --> 00:08:42.460
Jill kept your body immersed in sap
 in order for it to heal.

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:45.390
Oh, that's what that was?

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:47.830
Here. Put on some clothes on, would ya?

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:53.220
I feel like I was asleep 
for a really long time.

00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:56.650
Indeed. In human time, it was...

00:08:56.650 --> 00:08:58.600
About two years, I'd say.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:00.330
Two years?!

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:02.470
I'd say it was closer to three, really.

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:07.290
Of course! I lose track of
 how much time passes when I'm with you!

00:09:07.290 --> 00:09:09.320
Oh, Myr!

00:09:09.320 --> 00:09:11.360
Wait! Wait, wait, wait, wait!
 That can't be right!

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:13.720
What happened to the others, then?!

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:16.990
Who knows? Haven't seen 'em.

00:09:16.990 --> 00:09:18.660
Crap, crap, crap!

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:22.530
Alma will kill me for 
not calling her in three years!

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:24.870
Wait, no!

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:30.130
Calm down, silly. Listen to me.

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:34.260
Time in this forest doesn't move
 at the same pace as in the outside world.

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:38.010
Time moves at a different pace?

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:41.050
If human time moves in a straight line,

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:46.020
time in Caillte's forest is like
 a circle stuck to that line.

00:09:46.360 --> 00:09:51.060
This place has its own unique flow of time
 that's unrelated to the outside.

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:53.330
No matter how many years
 you spend here,

00:09:53.330 --> 00:09:59.160
if you so wish, you can leave
 at a time just after you arrived.

00:09:59.160 --> 00:10:02.690
Then when you said "two years" 
and "three years" earlier...

00:10:02.690 --> 00:10:06.290
That only refers to the time 
you've experienced here.

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:09.770
Just forget about time
 while you're in this place.

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:13.180
I don't quite get it, but...

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:16.050
That just means
 I can train all I want, right?

00:10:16.050 --> 00:10:20.800
Train? That's why you stayed here?

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:25.300
Yeah, so I can control
 this dangerous power I have.

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:28.440
So I won't ever hurt my friends again.

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:38.200
Well, that ain't my business. 
You can do as you please.

00:10:38.540 --> 00:10:40.790
No, it has to be you!

00:10:40.790 --> 00:10:45.830
I know you use Fantasia with 
your bare hands, just like me!

00:10:47.970 --> 00:10:53.070
Please, teach me how to control Fantasia!

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:57.280
You really don't understand anything.

00:10:57.280 --> 00:11:01.820
If you want me to train you that badly...
 All right, then.

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:03.850
Just try to catch me!

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:08.100
I don't think you can, though!

00:11:09.580 --> 00:11:10.980
All right!

00:11:13.980 --> 00:11:19.990
<b>[Caillte Forest] 
A forest in which a time different from real time flows.
 If you get lost here, you might get lost in time.</b>

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:24.120
It's not just time 
that's different here.

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:27.120
Space also expands and contracts.

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:32.080
Look well, strain your ears, 
and feel the world around you.

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:35.380
If you can't do that, 
you'll never catch me.

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:39.130
I don't get it,
 but I just have to catch you, right?

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:44.760
You're kidding me!

00:11:53.980 --> 00:11:55.060
Ow...

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:57.690
You aren't attentive enough.

00:11:57.690 --> 00:12:00.530
You're seeing everything as your enemy.

00:12:02.030 --> 00:12:04.250
The land you tread upon,

00:12:04.250 --> 00:12:06.270
the wind on your skin...

00:12:06.270 --> 00:12:08.780
What's important
 is to open up your senses

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:12.790
and become one with the world, 
not make an enemy of it.

00:12:13.150 --> 00:12:15.390
I have no idea what you're saying.

00:12:24.250 --> 00:12:26.820
That wasn't bad,

00:12:26.820 --> 00:12:32.300
but the moment you opened your senses,
 you closed them again.

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:46.060
Hey, Myr...

00:12:47.020 --> 00:12:49.330
Why are you helping him?

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:52.500
The boy Yaga asked me to.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:55.080
He's a member of the 13 Sorcerer Coven.

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:58.000
Just because of that, 
you're doing all this?

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.590
You must be planning something else.

00:13:04.170 --> 00:13:05.720
You ran away!

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:08.140
Seth! Put your pants on!

00:13:08.140 --> 00:13:09.600
One more lap!

00:13:09.600 --> 00:13:11.210
Aw, already?

00:13:11.210 --> 00:13:13.230
Hurry it up!

00:13:52.150 --> 00:13:54.390
He's even faster than usual today!

00:14:00.870 --> 00:14:01.960
I dodged it?

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:04.150
What was that?

00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:15.660
<i>Again... It was as if I sensed something.</i>

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:17.710
Water...

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:22.170
Wind...

00:14:24.900 --> 00:14:27.170
Is that... Myr?

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:35.850
I feel it.

00:14:46.670 --> 00:14:47.940
Gotcha.

00:14:49.390 --> 00:14:51.080
Thanks!

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:55.700
Good. Looks like you've learned 
to sense the world around you.

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:59.960
Now you'll finally teach me 
how to use Fantasia, right?

00:14:59.960 --> 00:15:02.210
Who said I'd do that?

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:03.340
Huh?!

00:15:03.340 --> 00:15:07.030
You humans sure are dumb.

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:10.220
What you just did a moment ago proves that.

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:11.970
What I just did?

00:15:11.970 --> 00:15:17.040
Listen up. Fantasia is like air.

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:22.580
If all you do is gather it and force it out,
 it's no more than a fart.

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:24.980
A fart?

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:29.920
Communicate with nature
 and sense everything around you.

00:15:29.920 --> 00:15:32.390
You managed to do that a moment ago,

00:15:32.390 --> 00:15:35.390
because you opened your senses
 to the Fantasia that fills the world

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:37.240
and became one with it.

00:15:37.810 --> 00:15:39.500
That sensation was...

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:42.750
Since Jill healed you with that sap,

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:46.500
a part of this forest 
now resides within you.

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:53.010
Through that, you can now sense this place
 as an extension of your body.

00:15:53.620 --> 00:15:55.260
<i>So that's why...</i>

00:15:55.750 --> 00:15:59.860
When you achieve harmony with the world,
 you can even do this.

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:04.430
What?!

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:20.640
It can be used not only to destroy,
 but to create.

00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:24.490
It's not the same as just making
 loud noises or spouting flames.

00:16:24.490 --> 00:16:27.430
This is what true magic is.

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:28.840
Wow...

00:16:28.840 --> 00:16:33.930
But in your case, simply harmonizing
 with Fantasia isn't enough.

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:38.170
You must defeat that
 which resides within you.

00:16:38.170 --> 00:16:40.930
You mean what I was 
when I lost control?

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:47.290
Let's call it the freeloader
 that lives inside you and takes you over.

00:16:49.140 --> 00:16:50.570
What do I do?

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:55.320
Gather more Fantasia.

00:16:55.320 --> 00:16:57.740
Push yourself to the limit.

00:16:57.740 --> 00:17:01.090
There's no other way 
to make him appear.

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:06.870
Here he comes.

00:17:06.870 --> 00:17:10.090
Throw your very being at him!

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:28.160
Keep a hold of yourself.

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:31.360
Don't lose your link with the world.

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:34.930
I know, but...

00:17:59.180 --> 00:18:01.050
Ow, my head!

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:04.240
You lost your senses and attacked me,

00:18:04.240 --> 00:18:06.640
so I reflexively hit you.

00:18:06.640 --> 00:18:10.070
Oh... So it didn't work.

00:18:10.070 --> 00:18:13.690
What did it feel like
 when the freeloader took over?

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:16.080
Could you see your surroundings?

00:18:16.080 --> 00:18:17.280
Yeah.

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:22.290
But it was like... my senses
 were removed from the Fantasia.

00:18:22.890 --> 00:18:26.260
And... I don't feel anything from him.

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:29.290
It's as if he's not even there.

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:33.860
Isn't he trying to control you?

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:35.170
No.

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:37.620
I don't know how to explain it,

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:38.830
but, well...

00:18:39.310 --> 00:18:42.180
He's like a hole in a wall.

00:18:42.910 --> 00:18:46.990
It feels like someone is watching me
 through that hole.

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:51.450
Try it once more, Seth.

00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:54.690
You may learn who your freeloader is.

00:18:57.290 --> 00:19:00.900
<i>Meanwhile, the mysterious man, 
Diabal, and his comrades</i>

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:03.470
<i>were searching for Seth.</i>

00:19:03.470 --> 00:19:08.810
<i>What they feared was the one
 pulling the strings behind it all:</i>

00:19:08.810 --> 00:19:10.210
<i>Piodon.</i>

00:19:11.090 --> 00:19:14.630
<i>It's no use.
 We cannot locate the horned boy.</i>

00:19:14.630 --> 00:19:19.220
<i>We've informed the other members 
and had them investigate, but...</i>

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:24.600
Those knights you guys use as a cover
 are completely useless, too.

00:19:24.600 --> 00:19:29.810
<i>Diabal, why didn't you use your power
 when the boy sneaked in?</i>

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:32.350
<i>That's why all this happened.</i>

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:36.610
Because there was a chance 
Piodon would find me.

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:41.910
<i>Piodon... He's the one 
you came here to escape.</i>

00:19:41.910 --> 00:19:46.320
Yes. As long as I remain hidden 
within the castle's barrier,

00:19:46.320 --> 00:19:47.990
I can avoid him.

00:19:47.990 --> 00:19:52.260
<i>And that's why you need 
to protect this castle.</i>

00:19:52.260 --> 00:19:56.230
<i>You share the same interests we do,</i>

00:19:56.230 --> 00:19:58.250
<i>and we protect this land
 from outside enemies.</i>

00:19:59.650 --> 00:20:04.430
<i>Was the horned boy's appearance
 also Piodon's doing?</i>

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:06.490
I don't know.

00:20:06.490 --> 00:20:11.730
But either way,
 I'm certain Piodon is trying to use him.

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:13.760
That's the kind of man he is.

00:20:13.760 --> 00:20:17.010
And if the boy fails
 to live up to his expectations,

00:20:17.010 --> 00:20:18.270
he'll break him.

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:21.490
Just like he did to me.

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:29.500
That's it.

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:34.540
I'll watch what happens to you
 from the realm of Sidh.

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:44.390
All right, try to take control
 of your freeloader.

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:54.190
I see the freeloader.

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:57.190
He's stretching out his feelers
 in all directions

00:20:57.500 --> 00:21:00.940
to try to control the orb
 that surrounds you.

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:05.820
When he does that,
 you'll lose control of yourself.

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:09.330
But I still can't tell 
what this thing is.

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:17.730
Myr, what happened?

00:21:17.730 --> 00:21:18.960
What's going on?!

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:23.130
I see. It's just as you said.

00:21:23.130 --> 00:21:25.650
It's no more than a peephole.

00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:29.640
If your will weakens,
 and you lose the protection of the orb,

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:32.350
it probably intends to offer you up.

00:21:32.350 --> 00:21:35.230
Offer me up to who?!

00:21:35.230 --> 00:21:39.730
I don't know.
 Something that's searching for you.

00:21:39.730 --> 00:21:44.740
Your freeloader is trying
 to bring that something here.

00:21:46.020 --> 00:21:48.140
It's getting to be more 
than I can handle.

00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:49.610
That's all for now.

00:21:55.790 --> 00:22:00.000
I was right.
 It lost sight of what it was searching for.

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:01.420
It's withdrawing.

00:22:02.130 --> 00:22:08.620
Seth, why did that "brother" of yours 
put something like this in you?

00:22:08.620 --> 00:22:11.760
Was he really trying to help you?

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:29.990
To Be Continued

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:20.790
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:00.900 --> 00:24:02.950
<i>A new Nemesis appears.</i>

00:24:03.370 --> 00:24:07.150
<i>The Knights-sorcerers succeed
 in subjugating it,</i>

00:24:07.610 --> 00:24:12.730
<i>but what they thought they'd defeated 
divides into multiple Echo Nemesis.</i>

00:24:13.310 --> 00:24:16.080
<i>Only Ocoho and Melie, 
who were left behind,</i>

00:24:16.080 --> 00:24:20.020
<i>realize that they are only mimics 
and set out to fight them.</i>

00:24:20.540 --> 00:24:23.690
<i>Next time on <i>Radiant</i>,
 "The Qualifications of a Knight."</i>

00:24:20.790 --> 00:24:25.020
<b>The Qualifications of a Knight 
-Quality-</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>Be sure to watch next time!</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>End</b>
